@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Demo data and privacy"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS DEMO</p><h1>Sample data. Your own workspace.</h1></div></div>
<article class="panel reading-panel"><h2>What this website does</h2><p>ABC Retail is Mohammed Ba Yazed's personal continuation of a university web application. You can try customer, product, order, file and activity workflows without creating an account. All business actions are simulations.</p><h2>What to enter</h2><p>Use fictional names, example.invalid email addresses and sample files. Do not upload real contracts or enter confidential information. No email, payment, delivery or Azure operation takes place.</p><h2>How long data lasts</h2><p>The app stores your records and uploads in temporary server memory for a workspace lasting up to 45 minutes. A restart clears that memory. An expired workspace becomes inaccessible immediately and is removed when another workspace request arrives. The reset button clears only your own workspace.</p><h2>Cookies and hosting logs</h2><p>Session, antiforgery and message cookies support the demo. Browsers with separate cookie storage receive separate workspaces. The hosting provider can retain request logs such as IP addresses; these are separate from the temporary demo records.</p><h2>File limits</h2><p>Each workspace permits up to 20 files and 6 MB combined, with a 2 MB per-file limit. Upload checks inspect file signatures; they are not a full image decoder, PDF sanitizer or malware scanner. PDFs are downloaded as attachments.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" asp-controller="Demo" asp-action="Index">Open demo controls</a></article>
